### 2026-10-11 (UTC) — first baseline
- table Card: base_ref, new_paths removed and _base, _new added in one edit — if that is a rename the wire id moved with the name and every stored value orphans: declare it `_base ... | was = "base_ref"`, and pair `json = "base_ref"` if the text key must survive (docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §5, §16.4) [warn]

### 2026-11-21 (UTC) — rendering version 9: a bits(N) field records its width (bits=), a counted array its minimum count (mincount=) and a deprecated enum variant its marker (deprecated=true), so a narrowed width warns, a moved minimum refuses and a deprecation warns (docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §18.1)
